{
  "name": "perch",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/perch.py): a European perch, 30 cm -- a HUMPED back rising behind a small head, deepest over the pelvics; a big terminal mouth, the gill cover's edge carved and its spine; TWO separate dorsal fins, the first tall and SPINY (the membrane notched between the spines, a black blotch at its rear), the second soft; 7 dark VERTICAL BARS, broad on the back and fading down the greenish-gold flanks to a pale belly; the pelvic and anal fins red-orange, the tail orange-brown, the pectorals pale amber; small rowed scales, the lateral line painted; a big golden eye. Each fin is one membrane sheet. A SWIMMER (the fish's plumbing: `fly`, `alt` its depth).",
